      "revision": 1329389699,
      "text": "Astragalus atropilosulus is a perennial herb in the family Fabaceae. It is native to Eastern Africa and some parts of the Arabian Peninsula."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Astragalus atropilosulus",
