        "retrieved": "2026-10-17",
        "revision": 1329389699,
        "heading": "Uses",
        "text": "The leaves are used as a side dish and are sometimes mixed with the leaves of Solanum nigrum. \nThe roots are added to hot milk to help a woman having uterine pains after childbirth.",
